  ObjectSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4cf37ba9e3e1ae54b9338e49ece41158, type: 3}
  Facts:
  - text: "Nature\u2019s Battery!\nThe electric eel can produce up to 600 volts of
      electricity\u2014enough to stun prey or scare off predators!\nIt uses this
      power to hunt in dark, muddy waters, where eyesight doesn\u2019t help much.\nEven
      though it\u2019s called an eel, it\u2019s actually more like a knifefish.\nIt
      \u201Ctalks\u201D to other eels with small zaps\u2014an underwater Morse code!"
